<title>POLAND: OPTIMUS SEPT NET SOARS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>OPTIMUS SEPT NET SOARS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.46 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.40 vs   1.04</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.43 vs   1.39</p>
<p> Sales		   41.32 vs  31.59</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.41 vs   5.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.99 vs  10.26</p>
<p> Operating profit    15.21 vs   8.35</p>
<p> Sales		  293.57 vs 192.34</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish is Optimus SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
